{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/be34fe29b0c5056b709a88d927335dfd.apng?t=1772459564\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/be34fe29b0c5056b709a88d927335dfd.poster.avif?t=1772459564\" class=\"bb_img\" width=661 height=70 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fast, skill-based arcade shooting meets roguelite builds, screen control, and <strong>particle-driven chaos</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dodge, aim, and exploit the playfield</strong> itself while crafting <strong>absurdly powerful runs</strong> through rule-breaking upgrades.<br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/e43962b57905751539930226d783ab16.poster.avif?t=1772459564\" width=1148 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/e43962b57905751539930226d783ab16.webm?t=1772459564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/e43962b57905751539930226d783ab16.mp4?t=1772459564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From a gameplay perspective, \u2119articuliti\ud835\udd4f (\u2119\ud835\udd4f for short) draws inspiration from <strong>twin-stick shooters, roguelites, survivor games, and incremental systems</strong>, blending them into a pure arcade experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/1446f1c91f4ba8a4256854cccf198a44.poster.avif?t=1772459564\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/1446f1c91f4ba8a4256854cccf198a44.webm?t=1772459564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/1446f1c91f4ba8a4256854cccf198a44.mp4?t=1772459564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/c00cbec685dc7c61d9beee2c4c66a20e.apng?t=1772459564\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/c00cbec685dc7c61d9beee2c4c66a20e.poster.avif?t=1772459564\" class=\"bb_img\" width=619 height=83 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each <strong>run</strong>, reshape your arsenal through <strong>impactful, run-defining upgrades</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat waves </strong>and\u00a0<strong>bosses</strong> to unlock new <strong>levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And after each run,</strong> upgrade your character to progress ever further</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploit</strong> specific <strong>zones</strong> of the screen to get extra bonuses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/a1626efa26685a276b97d73d4cf65852.poster.avif?t=1772459564\" width=800 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/a1626efa26685a276b97d73d4cf65852.webm?t=1772459564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/a1626efa26685a276b97d73d4cf65852.mp4?t=1772459564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Choose Your Style</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your weapon choice defines your gameplay.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a weapon <strong>you have to aim</strong>  for a classic, high-control <strong>twin-stick</strong> shooter experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, pick a weapon that <strong>aims automatically</strong>, letting you focus 100% on movement, dodging, and strategic positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/07f7a9ae15b80a5365ead0a0421f0fe9.poster.avif?t=1772459564\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/07f7a9ae15b80a5365ead0a0421f0fe9.webm?t=1772459564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/07f7a9ae15b80a5365ead0a0421f0fe9.mp4?t=1772459564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Find Your Build</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine dozens of unique upgrades to create a new death engine every run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are just a few examples: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spicy bounce</strong>: Each time a bullet bounces, its damage is doubled. If you have fragments or DoTs they keep this boost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laser</strong>: You now shoot lasers that do 8x damage... You can only shoot up to 8 lasers in the air... But they can combine with fragments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mimic</strong>: Your ship mimics the appearance of the enemies chasing you. They won't chase you unless you fire. Shooting breaks the disguise for a short time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/ea37d99993d044f3eb0596ab1e5ffc2c.poster.avif?t=1772459564\" width=970 height=566 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/ea37d99993d044f3eb0596ab1e5ffc2c.webm?t=1772459564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/ea37d99993d044f3eb0596ab1e5ffc2c.mp4?t=1772459564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Positioning Is Power</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In \u2119\ud835\udd4f, the playfield isn\u2019t neutral. <strong>Positioning matters as much as what you shoot.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>XP </strong>doesn\u2019t come to you.<strong> </strong>You have to<strong> risk your position to grab it.</strong><br>Timing your pickups around special zones can turn a dangerous move into a massive advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Temporary zones </strong>appear across the screen, offering powerful <strong>situational bonuses.</strong><br>Exploiting them at the right moment is often the key to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Positioning creates momentum.</strong><br>Holding the right area, even briefly, can decide whether a run snowballs\u2026 or collapses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Builds don\u2019t just stack numbers \u2014 <strong>they change how you play the space</strong>.<br>Upgrades interact with movement, positioning, and timing, turning the screen into something you actively manipulate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master \u2119\ud835\udd4f by mastering <strong>space, risk, and opportunity</strong>, not just firepower\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A Note From the Dev</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It started life as a simple arcade game to toy with graphics made entirely of particles. <br>And it then evolved into an arcade-roguelite to conform to my tastes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to help shape the game join the Discord</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for your interest !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4139330?t=1772459564","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/843e14293b15242da8b58080222b8f4978873be0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772459564","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/57c1a126ec53468c1459f117832859ccbb801d41/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772459564","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/57c1a126ec53468c1459f117832859ccbb801d41/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772459564","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4216980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/be34fe29b0c5056b709a88d927335dfd.apng?t=1772459564\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/be34fe29b0c5056b709a88d927335dfd.poster.avif?t=1772459564\" class=\"bb_img\" width=661 height=70 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fast, skill-based arcade shooting meets roguelite builds, screen control, and <strong>particle-driven chaos</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dodge, aim, and exploit the playfield</strong> itself while crafting <strong>absurdly powerful runs</strong> through rule-breaking upgrades.<br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/e43962b57905751539930226d783ab16.poster.avif?t=1772459564\" width=1148 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/e43962b57905751539930226d783ab16.webm?t=1772459564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/e43962b57905751539930226d783ab16.mp4?t=1772459564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From a gameplay perspective, \u2119articuliti\ud835\udd4f (\u2119\ud835\udd4f for short) draws inspiration from <strong>twin-stick shooters, roguelites, survivor games, and incremental systems</strong>, blending them into a pure arcade experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/1446f1c91f4ba8a4256854cccf198a44.poster.avif?t=1772459564\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/1446f1c91f4ba8a4256854cccf198a44.webm?t=1772459564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/1446f1c91f4ba8a4256854cccf198a44.mp4?t=1772459564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/c00cbec685dc7c61d9beee2c4c66a20e.apng?t=1772459564\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/c00cbec685dc7c61d9beee2c4c66a20e.poster.avif?t=1772459564\" class=\"bb_img\" width=619 height=83 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each <strong>run</strong>, reshape your arsenal through <strong>impactful, run-defining upgrades</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat waves </strong>and\u00a0<strong>bosses</strong> to unlock new <strong>levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And after each run,</strong> upgrade your character to progress ever further</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploit</strong> specific <strong>zones</strong> of the screen to get extra bonuses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/a1626efa26685a276b97d73d4cf65852.poster.avif?t=1772459564\" width=800 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/a1626efa26685a276b97d73d4cf65852.webm?t=1772459564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/a1626efa26685a276b97d73d4cf65852.mp4?t=1772459564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Choose Your Style</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your weapon choice defines your gameplay.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a weapon <strong>you have to aim</strong>  for a classic, high-control <strong>twin-stick</strong> shooter experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, pick a weapon that <strong>aims automatically</strong>, letting you focus 100% on movement, dodging, and strategic positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/07f7a9ae15b80a5365ead0a0421f0fe9.poster.avif?t=1772459564\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/07f7a9ae15b80a5365ead0a0421f0fe9.webm?t=1772459564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/07f7a9ae15b80a5365ead0a0421f0fe9.mp4?t=1772459564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Find Your Build</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine dozens of unique upgrades to create a new death engine every run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are just a few examples: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spicy bounce</strong>: Each time a bullet bounces, its damage is doubled. If you have fragments or DoTs they keep this boost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laser</strong>: You now shoot lasers that do 8x damage... You can only shoot up to 8 lasers in the air... But they can combine with fragments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mimic</strong>: Your ship mimics the appearance of the enemies chasing you. They won't chase you unless you fire. Shooting breaks the disguise for a short time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/ea37d99993d044f3eb0596ab1e5ffc2c.poster.avif?t=1772459564\" width=970 height=566 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/ea37d99993d044f3eb0596ab1e5ffc2c.webm?t=1772459564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/extras/ea37d99993d044f3eb0596ab1e5ffc2c.mp4?t=1772459564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Positioning Is Power</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In \u2119\ud835\udd4f, the playfield isn\u2019t neutral. <strong>Positioning matters as much as what you shoot.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>XP </strong>doesn\u2019t come to you.<strong> </strong>You have to<strong> risk your position to grab it.</strong><br>Timing your pickups around special zones can turn a dangerous move into a massive advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Temporary zones </strong>appear across the screen, offering powerful <strong>situational bonuses.</strong><br>Exploiting them at the right moment is often the key to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Positioning creates momentum.</strong><br>Holding the right area, even briefly, can decide whether a run snowballs\u2026 or collapses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Builds don\u2019t just stack numbers \u2014 <strong>they change how you play the space</strong>.<br>Upgrades interact with movement, positioning, and timing, turning the screen into something you actively manipulate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master \u2119\ud835\udd4f by mastering <strong>space, risk, and opportunity</strong>, not just firepower\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A Note From the Dev</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It started life as a simple arcade game to toy with graphics made entirely of particles. <br>And it then evolved into an arcade-roguelite to conform to my tastes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to help shape the game join the Discord</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for your interest !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Workshop Geek"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139330/bfcb9e4eee6cd4845bd24d9df94b577fa010ff86/header.jpg?t=1772459564","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 3.14+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Celeron 300A<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Yes, you need one<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> I miss them<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> I use arch btw</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4139330/2090059425/b28c1f91f2e37a1579986a50aa15cf34e1a15d79/1770650165/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770654121","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4139330/2090059425/b28c1f91f2e37a1579986a50aa15cf34e1a15d79/1770650165/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770654121","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4139330/2090059425/b28c1f91f2e37a1579986a50aa15cf34e1a15d79/1770650165/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770654121","id":257261053,"name":"Particulitix - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/25726